<title>FINLAND: TABLE-PK-CABLES 6-MTH PROFIT UP 33 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PK-CABLES 6-MTH PROFIT UP 33 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June,</p>
<p>					(million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	  21.81 vs 16.46</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.02 vs 2.24</p>
<p> Net sales					 183.90 vs 110.65</p>
<p> Operating profit				 21.89 vs 16.96</p>
<p> Net financial items		   charge 0.08 vs 0.5 charge</p>
<p> Depreciation				     2.87 vs 2.27</p>
<p> Taxes						5.97 vs 4.68</p>
<p> Net profit					15.30 vs 11.99</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of  Finnish industrial electric wiring and</p>
<p>components maker is PK-Cables Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 248, news@reuters.fi</p>
